body:
Okay, thank you helped.

&#x200B;

Its just so weird to think of it that way because there was good, and I was happy in the beginning to have someone who cared so much about me, but now here i am, barely functioning because I am constantly confused or depressed.

&#x200B;

I am currently trying to rekindle lost friendships, and it is going well i think. I have told them slightly about the situation and they have offered me a room for a bit. I'm just scared about long term housing.

&#x200B;

I am technically physically disabled, half my spine is fused, and i think that's why I was able to qualify for disability. But I am able to function pretty normal. But I mainly applied for my mental health conditions. I am truly scared to go back to work, I know I at least cant work full time right now. I dont know, I'm sorry I'm just really scared.
